<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/FunctionalSafety/verificationPostcondition> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Verification postcondition are explicit criteria, states, or conditions that are true immediately after a verification method (such as a test, inspection, or analysis) has been performed, confirming the successful execution and complete outcomes of the verification."@en .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/hasTestCase> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Every to Element is a test case for the from Element (from hasTestCase to)."@en .
